{"cell":{"codeSha256":"062e82823faa196f2765a31a9a8edf0ab2093116e5d09a0ec49dcaebb92b41b9","config":{"column":null,"disabled":false,"expand_output":false,"hide_code":true},"id":"lEQa","name":"niche_sweep_method"},"console":[],"outcome":"completed","output":{"channel":"output","data":"<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"niche-sweep-squidpy\">Niche sweep (Squidpy)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The loop below writes one <code>niche_k{k}_res0.3</code> column per neighborhood size <code>k</code>\n(<strong>8</strong> and <strong>30</strong>) at fixed Leiden resolution <strong>0.3</strong>. On this static page the\ncolumns are <strong>precomputed</strong>; in molab, re-run the cell after you change the cache\npath or delete the parquet file.</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">NICHE_KS</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">sq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gr</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">spatial_neighbors</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">adata</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">coord_type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"generic\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">n_neighs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">_niche_neighborhood</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">adata</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"cell_type\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">scale</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">n_neighbors</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resolutions</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">NICHE_RESOLUTIONS</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">adata</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">obs</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"niche_k</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">_res0.3\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">adata</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">obs</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"nhood_niche_res=0.3\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">astype</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>","mimetype":"text/markdown"},"projectionSha256":"ccb8a602d4545759b00bb8846444eb3d0ee894f94e3f9e15c920166b73949573","resources":{"files":{},"functions":{},"modelNotifications":[],"uiValues":{}},"schema":"marimo.cell.v1"}